     "value": "Levetiracetam from 1 month; sodium valproate added at 2 months; at 4 months phenytoin bolus, midazolam infusion (up to 8 mg/kg/minute), thiopental (up to 5 mg/kg/hour; partial clinical response), clobazam, topiramate and ketogenic diet; PICU admission, intubation, extubation to noninvasive ventilation, re-intubation, resuscitation. No improvement.",
